===== .claude/rules/forge-nextjs.md
Next.js 16 App Router. Request APIs (`params`, `searchParams`, `cookies()`, `headers()`) are async. Components are Server Components unless the file starts with `'use client'`. Request interception lives in `proxy.ts`. `next lint` no longer exists; lint runs through Biome.

===== .claude/rules/forge-prisma.md
Prisma 7. The connection URL lives in `prisma.config.ts`. Generator `prisma-client` with an explicit `output`; the client is imported from that path. Query hooks use Client Extensions.

===== .claude/rules/forge-typescript.md
TypeScript, strict. Bun is the runtime and package manager.

===== .claude/rules/forge-zod.md
Untrusted input is validated with Zod at boundaries. Types derive from schemas with `z.infer<typeof Schema>`.

